{"seq":2,"slug":"exemption-lookup-rule-evaluation-order","title":"免税证书查找与判定规则执行顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sales-tax-exemption-resale-certificate-management/tax-engine-exemption-determination/exemption-lookup-rule-evaluation-order","wordCount":3430,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"免税证书查找与判定规则执行顺序\">免税证书查找与判定规则执行顺序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-判定是一条有序管道-不是一次查表\">核心概念：判定是一条有序管道，不是一次查表</h2><p>计税引擎里&quot;这个订单免税吗&quot;这个问题，看起来像一次查表——拿着客户 ID 去证书库里捞一条记录，命中就免税。真实系统里它不是查表，而是一条<strong>有确定次序的判定管道</strong>：先把交易落到某个管辖区，再判断卖方在该管辖区有没有登记义务，再判断商品本身是否应税，最后才轮到&quot;客户有没有一张覆盖该管辖区的有效免税凭证&quot;。次序错了，结果就会在某个边界上系统性偏差。</p>\n<p>Stripe Tax 把这条管道写得很直白：启用客户免税后，引擎在每次计算时按固定流程走——<strong>加载该客户全部有效免税 → 与卖方负有纳税义务的管辖区做匹配 → 匹配到的管辖区税额定为 0，并把 <code>taxability_reason</code> 置为 <code>customer_exempt</code> → 未匹配到的管辖区照常课税</strong>（来源：Stripe《免税》开发者文档，docs.stripe.com/tax/exemptions，2026 访问）。四步的顺序固定，没有&quot;先看客户再定管辖区&quot;的捷径。</p>\n<p>为什么次序是架构问题而不是实现细节？因为<strong>同一个&quot;税=0&quot;的结果有三种成因</strong>，审计含义、举证责任、后续负债各不相同：客户持有有效免税凭证（<code>customer_exempt</code>）、商品本身在该管辖区不征税（<code>product_exempt</code>）、卖方在该管辖区没登记所以不代收（<code>not_collecting</code>）。如果管道在第一步就把三者压成一个 <code>is_exempt=true</code>，三年后税局来函时系统拿不出任何证据说明当初为什么没收税。次序的工程价值，就在于把成因保留到最后一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[订单行项目] --&gt; B[确定应税地&lt;br/&gt;客户地址层级]&#10;    B --&gt; C{卖方在该管辖区&lt;br/&gt;有登记义务?}&#10;    C --&gt;|无| D[税=0&lt;br/&gt;reason=not_collecting]&#10;    C --&gt;|有| E{商品税码&lt;br/&gt;应税?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[税=0&lt;br/&gt;reason=product_exempt]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[查找客户免税]&#10;    G --&gt; H{全局税务状态&lt;br/&gt;= exempt/reverse?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[税=0/仅逆向&lt;br/&gt;reason=customer_exempt]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J{存在作用域&lt;br/&gt;匹配且有效的免税?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| I&#10;    J --&gt;|否| K[按标准税率课税&lt;br/&gt;reason=standard_rated]\">flowchart TD\n    A[订单行项目] --&gt; B[确定应税地&lt;br/&gt;客户地址层级]\n    B --&gt; C{卖方在该管辖区&lt;br/&gt;有登记义务?}\n    C --&gt;|无| D[税=0&lt;br/&gt;reason=not_collecting]\n    C --&gt;|有| E{商品税码&lt;br/&gt;应税?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[税=0&lt;br/&gt;reason=product_exempt]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[查找客户免税]\n    G --&gt; H{全局税务状态&lt;br/&gt;= exempt/reverse?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[税=0/仅逆向&lt;br/&gt;reason=customer_exempt]\n    H --&gt;|否| J{存在作用域&lt;br/&gt;匹配且有效的免税?}\n    J --&gt;|是| I\n    J --&gt;|否| K[按标准税率课税&lt;br/&gt;reason=standard_rated]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>失败时的降级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定应税地</td>\n<td>收货地址/账单地址/IP</td>\n<td>管辖区五元组</td>\n<td>地址无效则报错，不静默猜测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>登记义务</td>\n<td>应税地 + 卖方登记表</td>\n<td>是否需代收</td>\n<td>无登记 → 税 0，但标记 not_collecting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品应税性</td>\n<td>商品税码 + 管辖区</td>\n<td>应税/免税/零税率</td>\n<td>未知税码 → 按标准税率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户免税查找</td>\n<td>客户 ID + 应税地 + 时点</td>\n<td>免税区间命中与否</td>\n<td>未命中 → 标准税率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理由码落库</td>\n<td>以上各步结果</td>\n<td>taxability_reason + 凭证 ID</td>\n<td>无理由码的零税记录不可审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"执行的先后次序-从管辖到登记再到凭证\">执行的先后次序：从管辖到登记再到凭证</h2><p>把上表展开成可实现的次序，第一步必须是<strong>定应税地</strong>，而不是查客户。原因是免税凭证的作用域是&quot;管辖区&quot;，而管辖区的确定与客户是谁无关。Stripe 的地址层级文档给出了这个确定过程的具体顺序：Customer v1 下依次尝试<strong>收货地址 → 账单地址 → 支付方式的账单明细（按发票默认、订阅默认、客户默认三级）→ 客户 IP</strong>，且地址存在但无效时<strong>不继续向后回退</strong>，而是直接抛 <code>customer_tax_location_invalid</code>（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/customer-locations）。这条&quot;存在即终止、无效即报错&quot;的规则很关键：它保证应税地不会被静默降级成某个更宽松的管辖区，从而不会把一次应税销售伪装成免税。</p>\n<p>第二步是<strong>登记义务判定</strong>，它先于凭证查找。Stripe 明确说明引擎&quot;只在有有效税务登记（tax registration）的管辖区计算税；客户所在地没有登记时计算出的税额为零&quot;（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/calculating）。这一步在凭证之前，是因为它决定&quot;这单根本不该由我代收&quot;，与客户有没有免税资格无关。工程上必须把这条零税与凭证免税分开存储——把它写成免税，等于替客户声明了一个他从未提交的资格。</p>\n<p>第三步才是<strong>客户免税查找</strong>，而这一步内部自己还有次序：全局税务状态优先于作用域免税（见下一节）。第四步是<strong>理由码落库</strong>。</p>\n<p>可以用一个顺序谓词把整条管道写成数学形式。设时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、管辖区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span>、客户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，客户的作用域免税集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，每条免税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 带作用域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>scope</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{scope}(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与有效期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[d^{start}_e, d^{end}_e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，全局状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>exempt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>exempt</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>scope</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{exempt}(t, j, c) = \\big[\\, g(c) = \\text{exempt} \\,\\big] \\;\\lor\\; \\exists\\, e \\in E(c):\\; j \\in \\text{scope}(e) \\;\\land\\; d^{start}_e \\le t &lt; d^{end}_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exempt</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exempt</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0906em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这个式子里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>scope</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j \\in \\text{scope}(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的判定<strong>不查任何外部系统</strong>，它只依赖已经落库的凭证记录——这正是把&quot;捕获与校验&quot;和&quot;判定&quot;分成两个章节的理由：捕获侧决定一条记录是否可信地进入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，判定侧只做纯函数式的匹配，见 <a href=\"../resale-certificate-capture-validation/resale-certificate-type-jurisdiction-model\">转售证书类型与管辖区模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态优先级-全局税务状态必须压过作用域免税\">状态优先级：全局税务状态必须压过作用域免税</h2><p>管道里最容易写反的一处优先级，是<strong>客户级全局税务状态</strong>与<strong>作用域免税</strong>的关系。Stripe 的模型是两个不同的对象：<code>customer.tax_exempt</code> 是取值 <code>none</code> / <code>exempt</code> / <code>reverse</code> 的全局状态，而作用域的免税配置（豁免某一州、某一税收类型）是独立的列表。文档给出的优先级规则是决定性的：<strong>全局税务状态为 <code>exempt</code> 或 <code>reverse</code> 时，它总是优先于任何已添加的作用域免税；此时界面会给出警告，作用域免税不生效，必须先把它设回&quot;应税&quot;（<code>none</code>）才能启用作用域免税</strong>（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/exemptions）。</p>\n<p>这个优先级的工程含义是：<strong>作用域免税是细粒度补充，全局状态是粗粒度总闸，总闸永远在细粒度之上</strong>。后果之一是&quot;看不见的过度免税&quot;——若某客户被误设为全局 <code>exempt</code>，他提交的、只覆盖俄亥俄州的转售证书记录在库里还在，判定时却被总闸吞掉，任何州都免。这类缺陷最难解释，因为出错的不是某条数据，而是优先级把一个局部资格放大成了全局资格。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>全局税务状态</th>\n<th>作用域免税</th>\n<th>判定结果</th>\n<th>是否落库为可审计凭证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>none（应税）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>标准税率</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>none（应税）</td>\n<td>有且该管辖区命中</td>\n<td>税 0，reason=customer_exempt</td>\n<td>是，凭证 ID 可回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>exempt（全局免税）</td>\n<td>任意（含无）</td>\n<td>所有管辖区税 0</td>\n<td><strong>否</strong>——无凭证支撑，风险点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reverse（逆向征收）</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>不代收，由买方自报</td>\n<td>不计入本系统纳税义务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>加拿大这类多税种联邦制是例外：Stripe 把加拿大的免税拆成两级——覆盖全部省份的联邦税（GST/HST）与州级税（PST/QST/RST）。一次针对 GST/HST 的免税在所有省份同时生效，而州级税免税只作用于该州；<code>pst</code> 只允许 <code>BC</code>/<code>SK</code>，<code>qst</code> 只允许 <code>QC</code>，<code>rst</code> 只允许 <code>MB</code>（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/exemptions）。也就是说&quot;管辖区&quot;这一维度在联邦制下本身分层，匹配必须同时比对<strong>国家、税种、税种所属州</strong>三个键，而不是只比一个州代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"作用域匹配与有效期区间求值\">作用域匹配与有效期区间求值</h2><p>匹配阶段的第二个维度是<strong>时间</strong>。上面的公式中，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^{start}_e \\le t &lt; d^{end}_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0406em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是判定一条免税在交易时点是否生效的全部条件。Stripe 对这两个字段给出一组可核验的约束：<code>effective_date</code> 必须是 UTC 当日或之后，<strong>免税生效日不可回溯</strong>；<code>expiration_date</code> 可省略（表示无到期日），若填写则必须晚于生效日；同一客户在每个模式下最多保留 500 条未删除的免税；<strong>允许为同一管辖区创建生效期重叠的免税</strong>——这正是续期的实现方式，11 月拿到次年凭证即可新建一条次年 1 月 1 日生效的记录，与旧记录重叠，等旧记录过期后再删；但<strong>起止日完全相同的两条免税会被拒绝</strong>，因为无法区分（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/exemptions）。</p>\n<p>这里有一个必须显式决策的边界：区间是左闭右开 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[d^{start}, d^{end})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 还是闭区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[d^{start}, d^{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。选闭区间时，&quot;到期日当天&quot;与&quot;新凭证生效日当天&quot;重叠会让两条记录同时命中，引擎必须消解；&quot;取最新生效的一条&quot;与&quot;任一命中即免&quot;在续期场景下结果相同，在降级场景（新凭证缩小了范围）下结果相反。较稳妥的做法是<strong>任一命中即免 + 记录命中的具体凭证 ID</strong>，让冲突可见而不是被静默择一。由于续期本就鼓励新旧凭证区间重叠，判定结果里必须保留&quot;这次用的是哪一条免税&quot;（<code>txe_...</code> 这样的 ID），否则无法回答&quot;十二月这单按旧凭证还是新凭证免的&quot;。这也解释了 Stripe 为何允许删除后仍能按 ID 取回、且返回 <code>deleted: true</code>（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/exemptions）——删除只是移出列表，历史判定仍要能溯源。</p>\n<p>还有一处次序陷阱值得单独记录：Stripe 的税额明细（tax breakdown）按<strong>国家、州、县、市、区</strong>排列，但文档明确写着<strong>这个顺序不代表优先级或适用顺序</strong>（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/calculating）。把展示顺序当成计算顺序去实现，会在多层管辖区（如两税叠加的城市）上产生错误累加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定结果的落库与可审计的理由码\">判定结果的落库与可审计的理由码</h2><p>管道的最后一步是把&quot;为什么&quot;写下来。系统至少要持久化四个字段才能支撑一次审计问询：<strong>理由码</strong>（<code>customer_exempt</code> / <code>product_exempt</code> / <code>not_collecting</code> / <code>standard_rated</code> / <code>zero_rated</code> / <code>reverse_charge</code>）、<strong>命中的凭证 ID</strong>、<strong>命中的管辖区键</strong>、<strong>判定时点</strong>。Stripe 在两个层面暴露这个理由码：Tax Calculation API 在 <code>tax_breakdown[].taxability_reason</code> 返回，Invoice 在 <code>lines.data[].taxes[].taxability_reason</code> 返回，Checkout Session 需 <code>expand[]=line_items.data.taxes</code> 才可见（来源：docs.stripe.com/tax/exemptions）。四种暴露路径不同，但语义是同一个枚举——工程设计时应把它当作<strong>一等公民字段</strong>，而不是渲染层的附带产物。</p>\n<p>理由码之所以关键，是因为它决定举证责任落在谁身上。Streamlined Sales Tax 的规则表述得很清楚：卖方在收到<strong>填写完整的</strong>免税凭证后免除责任，前提是<strong>没有主动招揽不当免税、也不存在欺诈</strong>；而如果免税声明本身不成立，<strong>由买方承担销售税、利息与罚金</strong>（来源：Streamlined Sales Tax 官方 FAQ，streamlinedsalestax.org）。也就是说，卖方免责的成立条件是&quot;有凭证 + 善意&quot;，两者都不成立时风险回到卖方。落库时若只写了&quot;免税&quot;没写&quot;依据哪张凭证、凭证覆盖哪个管辖区&quot;，卖方在事后无法证明自己善意——这正是&quot;审计防卸责&quot;要防的形态。</p>\n<p>一个具体的次序陷阱来自跨州转售：SST 允许未在免税州登记的买方提供<strong>另一州（含 SSTID）的 ID</strong>，且<strong>同一 ID 可支撑多州的转售声明</strong>；卖方通常<strong>无需核验买方 ID 号</strong>，唯一的例外是<strong>佐治亚州要求卖方核验</strong>（来源：streamlinedsalestax.org/for-businesses/exemptions）。把它翻译成管道语言就是：ID 校验这一步在大多数州是&quot;记录即可、不阻断&quot;，在佐治亚是&quot;必须阻断&quot;。同一个阶段在不同管辖区有不同的严格度，因此<strong>校验强度也必须是规则表驱动的一维</strong>，不能硬编码进主流程。相似的差异还出现在转售证书本身的接受面上——有的州不接受外州转售证书，加州则规定在代发货（drop shipment）场景下，若外州真实零售商未持有加州 seller&#39;s permit 或使用税登记证，则由加州代发方按零售价申报缴税（来源：加州 CDTFA Publication 121，cdtfa.ca.gov/formspubs/pub121）。这条规则改变了<strong>纳税义务人</strong>，而不仅是某一步的通过与否——它必须发生在管道的最前面，因为它决定了这单是否由本系统代收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>免税判定是一条有固定次序的管道，而不是一次查表；次序本身承载审计证据。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>顺序是：<strong>定应税地 → 判登记义务 → 判商品应税性 → 查客户免税 → 落理由码</strong>。应税地未定之前不查客户；地址存在但无效时报错，不向后降级。</li>\n<li>同一个&quot;税=0&quot;有三种成因（凭证免税、商品免税、无登记不代收），<strong>必须用不同的 <code>taxability_reason</code> 区分</strong>，否则零税记录不可审计。</li>\n<li><strong>全局税务状态优先于作用域免税</strong>：客户被设为全局 <code>exempt</code> 会吞掉所有州级凭证，形成看不见的过度免税。</li>\n<li>作用域匹配是三元组 <code>(国家, 税种, 州)</code> 而非单一州代码；联邦制地区（如加拿大 GST/HST 与 PST/QST/RST）必须分层比对。</li>\n<li>有效期用区间谓词求值，<strong>生效日不可回溯</strong>；续期靠&quot;允许重叠区间&quot;实现，因此判定结果必须保留命中的凭证 ID 以支持溯源。</li>\n<li>税额明细的管辖区排列顺序只是展示顺序，<strong>不是计算优先级</strong>。</li>\n<li>跨州转售的校验强度是规则表驱动的一维：多数州&quot;记录不阻断&quot;，佐治亚要求卖方核验 ID；代发货场景可能整体转移纳税义务人。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判定管道的输入质量由捕获与校验侧保证——一条凭证如何被可信地收录进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，以及凭证作用域如何建模，是相邻章节的主题：<a href=\"../exemption-entity-tax-id-model/exemption-scope-effectiveness-model\">免税作用域与生效性模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"免税证书查找与判定规则执行顺序","id":"免税证书查找与判定规则执行顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：判定是一条有序管道，不是一次查表","id":"核心概念-判定是一条有序管道-不是一次查表"},{"level":2,"text":"执行的先后次序：从管辖到登记再到凭证","id":"执行的先后次序-从管辖到登记再到凭证"},{"level":2,"text":"状态优先级：全局税务状态必须压过作用域免税","id":"状态优先级-全局税务状态必须压过作用域免税"},{"level":2,"text":"作用域匹配与有效期区间求值","id":"作用域匹配与有效期区间求值"},{"level":2,"text":"判定结果的落库与可审计的理由码","id":"判定结果的落库与可审计的理由码"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计税引擎免税判定模型（税基×产品应税性×资质匹配）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sales-tax-exemption-resale-certificate-management/tax-engine-exemption-determination/exemption-determination-engine-model"},"next":{"title":"免税计算边界与异常场景（部分免税/运费/多州/拆单）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sales-tax-exemption-resale-certificate-management/tax-engine-exemption-determination/exemption-calculation-edge-cases"}}